@startuml user-journey
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam activityBorderColor #4A90D9
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #E8F4FD
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3CD
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #F0AD4E
skinparam arrowColor #4A90D9
skinparam fontName "Helvetica"

title Radovid Bot — User Journey: Start a Game Session

start

:User types **/radovid start [game_type] [difficulty]**\nin a Discord text channel;

:Bot validates the command\n(guild_id, channel_id, parameters);

if (Existing active session\nin this channel?) then (yes)
  :Bot replies with an ephemeral error:\n"A session is already active here.\nUse /radovid join to participate.";
  stop
else (no)
endif

:Bot creates a new **GameSession** (status: **PENDING**)\nin SQLite;

:Bot registers User as **host** in\n**session_participants**;

:Bot posts a public embed in the channel:\n"🎮 **[Game Type]** session started!\n[Difficulty] | Waiting for Player 2…\n[Join button / /radovid join]";

fork
  :Player 2 clicks **Join button**\nor types **/radovid join**;
  :Bot validates Player 2\n(not the same user, not already in session);
  :Bot adds Player 2 to\n**session_participants**;
fork again
  :Timeout after 5 minutes\nif no Player 2 joins;
  :Bot cancels session (status: **CANCELLED**)\nand notifies channel;
  stop
end fork

:Bot updates session status to **ACTIVE**;

:Bot sends prompt request to **Ollama (Gemma 3 4b)**\nwith game type + difficulty + initial context;

:Ollama generates the **opening game scenario / prompt**;

:Bot posts the prompt as a Discord embed\nin the channel;

repeat

  :Both players respond to the prompt\nin the channel (text messages);

  :Bot collects responses and forwards to\n**Ollama** for feedback & next prompt generation;

  :Ollama evaluates responses:\n- Grammar & vocabulary corrections\n- Feedback notes\n- Score / hints;

  :Bot posts **AI feedback** for each player\n(corrections highlighted, hints provided);

  :Bot increments **round_number**\nand records **game_rounds** in SQLite;

  :Bot posts the **next round prompt**\nfrom Ollama;

repeat while (Session continues?\n(no /radovid end command)) is (yes)
->no: User types **/radovid end**\nor max rounds reached;

:Bot sets session status to **COMPLETED**\nand records **ended_at** in SQLite;

:Bot calculates **XP earned** per player\nbased on rounds, accuracy, participation;

:Bot updates **user_progress** table:\n- total_xp += earned_xp\n- current_level (recalculated)\n- streak_days (if played today)\n- last_activity_at = now;

:Bot checks for new **Achievements**\n(e.g., first game, streak milestones);\n→ Inserts into **achievements** table if earned;

:Bot saves **feedback_logs** for the session\n(original texts, corrections, notes);

:Bot posts the **Session Summary embed**:\n🏆 Session Complete!\n• Player 1: [XP] XP earned — Level [N]\n• Player 2: [XP] XP earned — Level [N]\n• Rounds played: [N]\n• Achievements unlocked: [list];

stop

@enduml
